nextHotFrameSP: CARD _ FpFromSp[nub, desiredHotFrameSP
! CirioNubAccess.RemoteAddrFault => GOTO beyondColdestFrame];
Start the summary from the "hotter of" either the hotFrame or the currentFrame.

